    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "2. Heard learned counsel for the parties and perused the record.\n3.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 783,
      "end": 850,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "According to the FIR, on 11.09.2021, the victim a young of 15 years had left her home for school,\nbut she did not reach school.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 851,
      "end": 978,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "11.09.2021",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 876,
          "end": 886
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2963718771934509
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "When the mother of the victim, telephoned the applicant, who was brother in relation, according to the FIR, the applicant told that he had lifted the victim and he would marry her.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 979,
      "end": 1159,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2770451605319977
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "4. Learned counsel for the applicant would submit that there are grave contradictions in the statements of the victim.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1160,
      "end": 1279,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1430995911359787
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "The victim was a consensual party.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1280,
      "end": 1314,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.35889875888824463
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "5. Learned State counsel would submit that the victim has already been examined as PW1 at trial.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1316,
      "end": 1412,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.15768678486347198
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "She has supported the prosecution case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1413,
      "end": 1453,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2925916910171509
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "The applicant was after her.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1454,
      "end": 1482,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.41316646337509155
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "He had raped her on multiple occasions.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1483,
      "end": 1522,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.450408011674881
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "The victim is a minor.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1523,
      "end": 1545,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.40598443150520325
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "She was recovered from the possession of the applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1546,
      "end": 1601,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4272725582122803
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "6. It is the stage of bail.",
